            "authorAssociation": "NONE",
            "body": "@jasonxue1 \r\nIn **mini.pick**, there are already default mappings for moving the selection up and down. You can use:\r\n\r\n- `<C-n>` to move the selection down  \r\n- `<C-p>` to move the selection up  \r\n\r\nSimilarly, to scroll the preview window, you can use:\r\n\r\n- `<C-b>` to scroll up  \r\n- `<C-f>` to scroll down  \r\n\r\nIf you want to remap `<C-j>` and `<C-k>` for selection movement, you can configure `mini.pick` like this:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nrequire(\"mini.pick\").setup({\r\n  mappings = {\r\n    -- Move selection up and down\r\n    move_down  = '<C-j>',\r\n    move_up    = '<C-k>',\r\n\r\n    -- Scroll in the preview window\r\n    scroll_down  = '<C-f>',\r\n    scroll_up    = '<C-b>',\r\n    scroll_left  = '<C-h>',\r\n    scroll_right = '<C-l>',\r\n  },\r\n})\r\n```",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/jasonxue1/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/jasonxue1\">@jasonxue1</a><br>\nIn <strong>mini.pick</strong>, there are already default mappings for moving the selection up and down. You can use:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;C-n&gt;</code> to move the selection down</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;C-p&gt;</code> to move the selection up</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Similarly, to scroll the preview window, you can use:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;C-b&gt;</code> to scroll up</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;C-f&gt;</code> to scroll down</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">If you want to remap <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;C-j&gt;</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;C-k&gt;</code> for selection movement, you can configure <code class=\"notranslate\">mini.pick</code> like this:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"require(&quot;mini.pick&quot;).setup({\n  mappings = {\n    -- Move selection up and down\n    move_down  = '&lt;C-j&gt;',\n    move_up    = '&lt;C-k&gt;',\n\n    -- Scroll in the preview window\n    scroll_down  = '&lt;C-f&gt;',\n    scroll_up    = '&lt;C-b&gt;',\n    scroll_left  = '&lt;C-h&gt;',\n    scroll_right = '&lt;C-l&gt;',\n  },\n})\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">require</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>mini.pick<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>).<span class=\"pl-c1\">setup</span>({\n  <span class=\"pl-smi\">mappings</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {\n    <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">--</span> Move selection up and down</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">move_down</span>  <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>&lt;C-j&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">move_up</span>    <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>&lt;C-k&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>,\n\n    <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">--</span> Scroll in the preview window</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">scroll_down</span>  <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>&lt;C-f&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">scroll_up</span>    <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>&lt;C-b&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">scroll_left</span>  <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>&lt;C-h&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">scroll_right</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>&lt;C-l&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>,\n  },\n})</pre></div>",
            "bodyText": "@jasonxue1\nIn mini.pick, there are already default mappings for moving the selection up and down. You can use:\n\n<C-n> to move the selection down\n<C-p> to move the selection up\n\nSimilarly, to scroll the preview window, you can use:\n\n<C-b> to scroll up\n<C-f> to scroll down\n\nIf you want to remap <C-j> and <C-k> for selection movement, you can configure mini.pick like this:\nrequire(\"mini.pick\").setup({\n  mappings = {\n    -- Move selection up and down\n    move_down  = '<C-j>',\n    move_up    = '<C-k>',\n\n    -- Scroll in the preview window\n    scroll_down  = '<C-f>',\n    scroll_up    = '<C-b>',\n    scroll_left  = '<C-h>',\n    scroll_right = '<C-l>',\n  },\n})",
